§ `Subsection (b)(5) and (d)(6): nonqualified use and depreciation`

-- 9 owned 3652 days (16 March 2016 to 15 March 2026), lived in it for the last 5 years (1826 days); the first 1826 days were rented: the ratio is 1826/3652 = 1/2.
`an owner of ten years who lived in it for the last five` MEANS `an individual who only owned and used the property` `ten years to the sale` `five years to the sale` EMPTY
`a gain of 200,000 half of it earned while rented` MEANS `the usual facts of a sale of a home` `the sale date` 200000 FALSE `an owner of ten years who lived in it for the last five` `a person with no part in the property` EMPTY FALSE FALSE FALSE
