`a joint return, the taxpayer does not elect` MEANS `the usual facts of a sale of a home` `the 2022 sale date` 100000 TRUE `a taxpayer who owned from 2012, used to 2013 and does not elect` `a spouse serving from 2014 to 2021 who owned and used nothing` EMPTY FALSE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT `s 121 the amount of the gain excluded from gross income` `a joint return, the taxpayer does not elect` EQUALS JUST 0
-- the roles swapped: the spouse owned, used and elects, and the taxpayer is the one serving: $100,000
`a joint return, the spouse owns and elects and the taxpayer serves` MEANS `the usual facts of a sale of a home` `the 2022 sale date` 100000 TRUE `a taxpayer serving from 2014 to 2021 who owned and used nothing` `a spouse who owned from 2012, used to 2013 and elects` EMPTY FALSE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT `s 121 the amount of the gain excluded from gross income` `a joint return, the spouse owns and elects and the taxpayer serves` EQUALS JUST 100000
