`a joint return, 730 days of use` MEANS `the usual facts of a sale of a home` `the 2022 sale date` 100000 TRUE `a taxpayer who owned from 2012, used 730 days and elects` `a spouse serving from 2014 to 2021 who owned and used nothing` EMPTY FALSE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT `s 121 the amount of the gain excluded from gross income` `a joint return, 730 days of use` EQUALS JUST 100000
