#ASSERT `s 121 the amount of the gain excluded from gross income` `a joint return, 729 days of use` EQUALS JUST 0

-- 20c a return that is not joint: "such individual's spouse" does not say "on a joint return", so the spouse's service suspends the period all the same (fork F30)
`no joint return, the spouse's service suspends the taxpayer's 5-year period` MEANS `the usual facts of a sale of a home` `the 2022 sale date` 100000 FALSE `a taxpayer who owned from 2012, used to 2013 and elects` `a spouse serving from 2014 to 2021 who owned and used nothing` EMPTY FALSE FALSE FALSE
